  "description": "Candidate Kim Chang-sik is not himself. Or perhaps it would make more sense to say that an ordinary, non-powered candidate at the prestigious Hero Academy is none other than Ha Jin-seok, the world’s greatest villain, reincarnated. When his initial plan of lying low fails, Jin-seok, A.K.A Chang-sik, starts changing the course of history. However, powerful people are beginning to take notice… And just as things are about to get precarious, instead of backing down, Chang-sik decides to dive headfirst into danger! Will he emerge victorious? Or be devoured?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59836807), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2378025792), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4858287), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000078967)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63729101)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nEnglish ([Lezhin US](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/revengeoftheantihero), [Lezhin X](https://www.lezhinx.com/detail/revengeoftheanti-hero)), [French](https://www.delitoon.com/detail/daf_1000656)",
